<title>SWEDEN: Swedish Sept trade surplus 10.7 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Swedish Sept trade surplus 10.7 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sweden's September trade surplus was 10.7 billion crowns, Statistics Sweden said on Monday.</p>
<p> SWEDISH TRADE BALANCE     Sept 96    Aug 96     12 mo to date</p>
<p> Exports			 49.6	 43.6	 570.6</p>
<p> Imports			 38.9	 33.8	 443.2</p>
<p> Trade balance		 +10.7	+9.8	 +127.4</p>
<p>Note - Figures in billions of crowns. Analysts polled by Reuters had forecast a 11.4 billion crown surplus.</p>
<p>--Stockholm newsroom, 46-8-700-1017</p>
</text>
